# File: font-win.prf

###
### NOTE: The mappings in this file are currently disabled (commented out)
###       because they did not work properly with the default 8x13 font on
###       Windows Vista. It is unclear if this problem still exists in 2026+ for
###       Windows 10 and/or Windows 11.
###

#
# This file defines attr/char mappings using a standard font for the Win32 API
# graphics backend (when the game was compiled via `main-win.c`). This allows
# the use of pseudo-graphic "pictures" for walls (normally `#`) and other game
# entities.
#
# The pseudo-graphic symbols used here are defined in the `lib/xtra/font/*.fon`
# files. There is only one special wall type, so we have to use special
# "colors".
#


### Terrain features ###


# Floors (white / centered dot)

# F:1:1/31

# Invis traps (white / centered dot)

# F:2:1/31


# Magma (slate / solid block)

# F:50:2/127
# F:52:2/127


# Quartz (light slate / solid block)

# F:51:9/127
# F:53:9/127


# Secret door (white / solid block)

# F:48:1/127

# Granite walls & permanent rock (white / solid block)

# F:56:1/127
# F:57:1/127
# F:58:1/127
# F:59:1/127
# F:60:1/127
# F:61:1/127
# F:62:1/127
# F:63:1/127

